<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Wit Gold Mining raises year shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Wit Gold Mining raises year shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     8.4	   vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.33	  vs 0.63</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.53	  vs 0.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		  3.01	  vs 2.28</p>
<p>    Retained profit	 0.80	  vs 0.12 loss</p>
<p>Full name: Witwatersrand Gold Mining Co Ltd (gold)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	-	    vs 0.55 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - The directors have resolved to make an issue of capitalisation shares to holders of ordinary shares registered in the books of the company at the close of business on October 18 in the ratio of two new fully paid ordinary no par value shares for every 100 shares held.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
